    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SETUP TODOs\n1. Replace `documentId` on every Google Sheets node below with your Household Ledger spreadsheet ID (see household-ledger-sheets-schema.md)\n2. Connect your Google Sheets credential (reused the same credential ID as your BNS workflows below \u2014 adjust if this is a different Google account)\n3. Activate this workflow, then grab the Production webhook URL from the Webhook node \u2014 that's what the mobile app POSTs to\n\nExpected POST body:\n`{ \"action\": \"get\" }`\n`{ \"action\": \"upsert\", \"item\": \"Basmati Rice\", \"category\": \"Pantry\", \"store\": \"Walmart\", \"price\": 9.52, \"qty\": 1, \"cadence\": \"Week\" }`\n`{ \"action\": \"remove\", \"item\": \"Basmati Rice\" }`\n`{ \"action\": \"clear\" }` \u2014 added 2026-08-08, empties every ShoppingList row (keeps the header)\n`{ \"action\": \"finalize\" }` \u2014 added 2026-08-08, doesn't change the list; sends a Telegram summary of the current list + total, same response shape as `get`\n\nResponse: `{ \"list\": [...rows], \"total\": 42.10, \"budget\": 200, \"remaining\": 157.90 }`\n\nSETUP TODO for `finalize`: `Send Finalize Summary`'s Telegram credential still shows a placeholder \u2014 wire it to the same bot already connected for Budget Alert Listener/Check-In Agent. Also verify `Clear ShoppingList Rows`' \"Number of Rows to Delete\" field live (written as `rowsToDelete` here by analogy, not confirmed against the real node schema).",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 380
      },
